-online/2026/11/26/fca-warns-financial-firms-to-control-ai-risks-or-face-action/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fca-warns-financial-firms-to-control-ai-risks-or-face-action/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:53 +0000</pubDate><description>The UK&#x27;s financial regulator has told financial firms they must address cybersecurity risks from the deployment of AI agents, or face regulatory action.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/277/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>WordPress removes six compromised plugins</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/wordpress-removes-six-compromised-plugins/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/wordpress-removes-six-compromised-plugins/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:39 +0000</pubDate><description>WordPress removed six compromised plugins before they could be released to the public.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/276/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Fake WordPress plugin hides from admins and bypasses security checks</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wordpress-plugin-hides-from-admins-and-bypasses-security-checks/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wordpress-plugin-hides-from-admins-and-bypasses-security-checks/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:59:40 +0000</pubDate><description>A malicious plugin can let attackers access websites without extra security steps and run harmful code on visitors&#x27; devices.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/275/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Todoist confirms data breach affecting some users</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/todoist-confirms-data-breach-affecting-some-users/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/todoist-confirms-data-breach-affecting-some-users/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:58:35 +0000</pubDate><description>The task management app says an attacker accessed its systems and downloaded details for a small number of accounts.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/274/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Holiday shopping scams: 4,400 fake sites ready to trick you</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/holiday-shopping-scams-4-400-fake-sites-ready-to-trick-you/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/holiday-shopping-scams-4-400-fake-sites-ready-to-trick-you/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:57:57 +0000</pubDate><description>Fortinet says criminals are using fake delivery sites and stolen data to target shoppers during the holiday season.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/273/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"></media:content></item><item><title>Roundcube Webmail updates fix 12 security flaws</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/roundcube-webmail-updates-fix-12-security-flaws/</link>