-safety-reports/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/ofcom-to-ask-big-online-services-to-publish-safety-reports/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:55:56 +0000</pubDate><description>Ofcom is consulting on rules that will force major social media and search sites to publish annual reports on how they keep users safe.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/267/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Fake wallpaper ads steal emails and social media data</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wallpaper-ads-steal-emails-and-social-media-data/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wallpaper-ads-steal-emails-and-social-media-data/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:54:50 +0000</pubDate><description>Fake wallpaper ads are installing software that steals emails and social media details from your computer.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/266/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Passkeys explained: a safer way to log in without passwords</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/passkeys-explained-a-safer-way-to-log-in-without-passwords/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/passkeys-explained-a-safer-way-to-log-in-without-passwords/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:54:32 +0000</pubDate><description>Passkeys have the potential to make traditional passwords obsolete, but there is still plenty of uncertainty surrounding them, including how they work and where they are stored.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/265/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>UK bank fraud losses rise as victims approve payments</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/uk-bank-fraud-losses-rise-as-victims-approve-payments/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/uk-bank-fraud-losses-rise-as-victims-approve-payments/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:53:03 +0000</pubDate><description>UK bank losses from fraud where victims approve payments have risen by 22% in the first half of 2026.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/264/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>1Password breach: Names and emails copied, vaults safe</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/1password-breach-names-and-emails-copied-vaults-safe/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/1password-breach-names-and-emails-copied-vaults-safe/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:52:47 +0000</pubDate><description>A password manager says an attacker stole some customer names and emails, but your saved passwords and vaults were not touched.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/263/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Most Black Friday deals are not the cheapest of the year</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/most-black-friday-deals-are-not-the-cheapest-of-the-year/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/most-black-friday-deals-are-not-the-cheapest-of-the-year/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:24 +0000</pubDate><description>New research shows that most Black Friday discounts are not the best prices of the year, so you do not need to rush to buy.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/235/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"></media:content></item><item><title>Holiday shopping scams nearly double, says McAfee report</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/holiday-shopping-scams-nearly-double-says-mcafee-report/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/holiday-shopping-scams-nearly-double-says-mcafee-report/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:09 +0000</pubDate><description>A new survey shows more people are falling for fake deals, with many losing money and having to cut back on essentials.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/234/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Thieves are using software flaws to steal your passwords and keys</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/thieves-are-using-software-flaws-to-steal-your-passwords-and-keys/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/thieves-are-using-software-flaws-to-steal-your-passwords-and-keys/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:11:53 +0000</pubDate><description>New data shows a sharp rise in criminals using known software weaknesses to steal login details and secret access keys.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/233/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item></channel></rss>
